18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"19 Aug, 2018"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThey're very quick and breezy games, and they smack you with the full force of multiple VN tropes and scenarios at once. One choice could lead you down a yandere route where you get eviscerated with a chainsaw, while another could be a true whirlwind romance. I cannot express how absolutely madcap and yet charming these games are to play\u201d<br>Visual Novels of the Year 2025 \u2013 Frezno's Raving Rants <br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_1d8675f55d2a77526b67c417fb7bc6fa1fb7682b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_1d8675f55d2a77526b67c417fb7bc6fa1fb7682b.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_a40206c490eecd22a2ccfa69f03494142e929371.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_a40206c490eecd22a2ccfa69f03494142e929371.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_f980156faaaf32db1097c08406db654edfb2ceba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_f980156faaaf32db1097c08406db654edfb2ceba.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_574a76bf23788c9dd925466cdb1cfd52e16de149.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_574a76bf23788c9dd925466cdb1cfd52e16de149.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_01bd861f0ba6471324970d97849f365127fa84e4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_01bd861f0ba6471324970d97849f365127fa84e4.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_188401eb6f48527bcc6cc741206bafc45341a380.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772811404","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/890750/ss_188401eb6f48527bcc6cc741206bafc45341a380.600x338.jpg?t=1772811404"}],"short_description":"Lily's Night Off is a visual novel, but not in the typical sense; as you progress in this game, your actions drastically change character personalities, story lines, and lead to unexpected outcomes.","steam_appid":890750,"support_info":{"email":"kyuppin@gmail.com","url":"kyuppin.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","type":"game","website":"https://kyuppin.com/lilys-night-off"}